Compare product identity, unit conversion evidence, receipt lot, delivery time and explicit receiving acceptance. An unauthorized substitute is not the ordered item; pending receiving confirmation stays uncertain. Deduct already reserved or consumed quantity only under matching receipt and unit identity. Keep ambiguous mappings separate and explain the discriminating scan or receiving confirmation required.
